        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki, MUKAMA ayacungwire Abburahamu, binu nibyo arukugamba ebirukukwata hanju ya Yakobbo: “Yakobbo taligaruka kuswazibwa kandi taligaruka kuhinduka ha maiso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
